Should get *every* resistance you can from dragons.  Depending on the
color you can get poison, sleep, fire, cold, shock and disintegration
resistance from different color dragon corpses.  The only two ways to
resist disintegration are wearing BDSM or eating a black dragon
corpse.  That makes the choice easy, munch.  You can't get reflection,
MR or acid from eating so that's why GDSM and SDSM are so popular.
The acid can be had from lizard corpses, and that's why that color
isn't popular for mail.  And if you *think* you have various
resistances that's not good enough.  Be *certain* you have as many as
you can, or at least as many as the dragons can supply.

So get close to hungry and go hunt the first dragon.  Eat it.  If it
takes several times starting over, even carry it when it has been
partially eaten so you can complete the meal.  Then get hungry again
and go for the next color.  If there are several blue ones, you'll
only need to eat one.  Use whatever tricks you can to either get
hungry faster (go back to a teleport level and bounce around, or
use a tinning kit on all of the dragon corpses).

